<p>     15-17	   150	 Indoil</p>
<p>     27-29	   200	 BP</p>
<p>    SUB-TOTAL:     600</p>
<p>LOADING FROM SAMBU JETTY</p>
<p>	6-8	    200	 BP</p>
<p>     23-25	   200	 Indoil</p>
